---

<Layout
  title="Research — Alma-Sophia Merscher"
  description="Research on loneliness, connection and wellbeing."
>
  <section class="wrap page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Research</p>
    <h1>What I work on</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead">
        During my PhD in Neuroscience, my research centered around fear and
        anxiety-related defensive states in humans. In a variety of experimental studies,
        we sought to understand how people psychophysiologically react to increasing
        levels of threat. I then became interested in loneliness and first empirical
        findings on a link between loneliness and so-called anti-democratic attitudes and
        behaviors. This motivated me to pursue how robust this link is, which mechanisms
        may lie behind it, and what we could do about it. This research has brought me
        together with a wonderful team of international scientists and non-academic
        stakeholders, gathering at a conference on loneliness and stigma that we organized
        in 2025, funded by the Volkswagen Foundation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-heading">Currently working on</h2>
    <ul class="wip">
      {
        inProgress.map((p) => (
          <li>
            <p class="status">{p.status}</p>
            <p class="authors">
              {p.authors.split(ME).map((part, i) =>
                i === 0 ? part : (
                  <>
                    <strong>{ME}</strong>
                    {part}
                  </>
                )
              )}
            </p>
            <h3>{p.title}</h3>
            <p class="blurb">{p.blurb}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>

    <h2 class="section-heading">Publications</h2>
    <ol class="pubs">
      {
        publications.map((p) => (
          <li>
            <span class="year">{p.year}</span>
            <div>
              <p class="authors">
                {/* own name in bold so readers can find it in long author lists */}
                {p.authors.split(ME).map((part, i) =>
                  i === 0 ? (
                    part
                  ) : (
                    <>
                      <strong>{ME}</strong>
                      {part}
                    </>
                  )
                )}
              </p>
              <p class="pub-title" lang={p.lang ?? undefined}>{p.title}</p>
              <p class="venue" lang={p.lang ?? undefined}>{p.venue}</p>
              <p class="meta">
                {p.note && <span class="note">{p.note}</span>}
                <a href={`https://doi.org/${p.doi}`} rel="noopener">
                  doi.org/{p.doi}
                </a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--accent-rust-deep);
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .prose {
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .prose p {
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin: 3rem 0 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .wip {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.8rem;
  }
  .wip li {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--border);
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
  }
  .wip p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .status {
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cat-2);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem !important;
  }
  .wip h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0.3rem;
  }
  .blurb {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .pubs {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.6rem;
  }
  .pubs li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr;
    gap: 0 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .year {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--accent-rust-deep);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
  }
  .pubs p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .authors {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .pub-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0.15rem 0;
  }
  .venue {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
    margin-top: 0.35rem !important;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
  .meta a {
    color: var(--accent-rust-deep);
    text-decoration: none;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .meta a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
  }
  .authors strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .pubs li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
